{"id":"W567dff7e5de2a527b32ec563","zh":"多重反射","en":"","name":"多重反射","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W567dff7e5de2a527b32ec563","text":"多重反射","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"S485febb6baf3bf8d3d0e","source_id":"P139","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"采用声-固多物理场耦合方法建立包括考虑列车多噪声源分布、列车-声屏障多重反射、开孔前板-多孔吸声材料-后板3 层夹芯板等多参数的声屏障声学性能预测模型,在与实测结果对比分析验证数值模拟结果准确性的基础上,进一步系统分析声屏障几何参数以及采用不同顶部形式声屏障的插入损失、声场变化、场点频谱特性问题。","citations":[{"source_id":"P139","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S2da0d04fcedacdcd4fcf","source_id":"P139","page":3,"page_end":3,"language":"zh","text":"因此本文的理论模型重点考虑了声屏障与高速列车车体间的多重反射作用, 预测结果将更加准确,并能反映声波客观实际的传播特征。","citations":[{"source_id":"P139","page":3,"page_end":3}]}],"sources":{"P139":{"id":"P139","title":"轨道交通声屏障多参数预测模型及降噪性能研究","authors":"宋杲,张小安,张晓芸,杨建近,徐磊,杨力","year":"2025","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2025.01.019","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"宋杲等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-research-on-multi-parameter-prediction-model-for-rail-transit-noise-barriers-and-noise-reduction-per"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"声波在车体和屏障之间反复反射，改变传播路径与局部声压。","language":"zh","source_id":"P139","paper_slug":"2025-research-on-multi-parameter-prediction-model-for-rail-transit-noise-barriers-and-noise-reduction-per","title":"轨道交通声屏障多参数预测模型及降噪性能研究","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W8aeae03af39e316c0584cf6a","name":"Multiple reflections","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W8aeae03af39e316c0584cf6a","name":"Multiple reflections","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"same_language_synonyms":[],"cross_language_equival